# Normalize line endings at the repository boundary.
# The history is pure LF (90/90 tracked text files), but core.autocrlf=true on
# Windows let two files slip into the index with CRLF, which rewrote them
# entirely on every subsequent edit. Declaring the rule here makes the
# normalisation explicit instead of depending on each machine's git config.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.woff2 binary
*.woff binary
*.ttf binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
